flowchart LR
  I["Intent<br/>the problem + the refusal it enables"]
  Sp["Spec<br/>parts, diagrams, honest limits"]
  Pl["Plan<br/>tasks with tests first"]
  T["Failing test<br/>fails for the stated reason"]
  C["Minimal code"]
  G["Gates<br/>reachability · mutation · traceability · CI"]
  K["Checkpoint commit"]
  M["Metrics + learnings"]
  H["Pre-edit hooks<br/>block invariant breaks"]:::hook
  I --> Sp --> Pl --> T --> C --> G --> K --> M
  M -. "incident, or a refusal that never fired" .-> I
  H -. "checked before every edit" .-> C
  classDef hook fill:#fff4d6,stroke:#c99a00,color:#5a4500
